    "sol": "By Fermat's Little Theorem or cyclicity mod 5: Since gcd(5, 5) = 1, 5⁴ ≡ 1 (mod 5). Thus (5)⁴¹ = (5⁴)¹⁰ × 5¹ ≡ (1)¹⁰ × 5 ≡ 0 (mod 5).",
    "form": "Fermat's Little Theorem: a^(p-1) ≡ 1 (mod p).",
    "exam": "GATE + Placement"
