    "sol": "By Legendre's formula, the number of trailing zeros in n! equals the highest power of 5 dividing n!, given by E5(n!) = ∑ ⌊n / 5^k⌋. Here for 1200!: ⌊1200/5⌋ = 240 + ⌊1200/25⌋ = 48 + ⌊1200/125⌋ = 9 + ⌊1200/625⌋ = 1 = 298 trailing zeros.",
    "form": "E5(n!) = ⌊n/5⌋ + ⌊n/25⌋ + ⌊n/125⌋ + ...",
